    "title": "Update: Teen Drowns in Waukegan Harbor; Investigation Ongoing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "18 hours ago WAUKEGAN, Ill. (WLIP)— May 20, 2026–A 17-year-old Waukegan boy has died after a drowning in Lake Michigan’s North Harbor, according to authorities. Police and fire crews were called around 5:30 p.m. Monday to the harbor at 199 East Madison Street for a report of a water rescue. Witnesses told responders the teen, identified as Gabriel Ramirez, had been swimming with friends in the harbor channel when he began to struggle and went under. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
